# Build context of the all-in-one image (Dockerfile at the repo root). Allowlist: only the folders the
# Dockerfile copies, so local data (.data/, .env, scratch folders, .git) never reaches the build.
# (docker-compose builds backend/ and frontend/ with their own .dockerignore files.)
*
!backend
!frontend
!docker

# ...minus local environments, caches, build output and data inside them
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
backend/media
backend/staticfiles
backend/tests
frontend/next-env.d.ts
frontend/out
